# EAS Build ignore
#
# Scope: this file is tuned for the only EAS-built artifact in the
# workspace today, `@workspace/codetry-handbook` (artifacts/codetry-handbook).
# If another artifact later starts using EAS Build, revisit the exclusions
# below — in particular the per-artifact `artifacts/*/...` entries — so we
# don't accidentally strip files that artifact needs on the EAS builder.
#
# When EAS Build uploads this project, it walks the entire pnpm workspace
# (because the codetry-handbook artifact is part of one). Without this file
# the upload was ~212 MB on every run because it dragged along every other
# artifact, all of attached_assets/, plus the handbook's web/PWA outputs.
# These exclusions strip everything that the Android/iOS native builders
# don't need, dropping the archive well under 80 MB.
#
# Format is identical to .gitignore. Patterns are relative to the workspace
# root (the directory EAS uploads). This file is read in addition to
# .gitignore — anything already ignored by git stays ignored.

# --- Other artifacts -------------------------------------------------------
# None of these are imported by the codetry-handbook native build.
artifacts/api-server/
artifacts/check-in/
artifacts/deer-lake-store-plan/
artifacts/headwaters-books/
artifacts/library/
artifacts/mockup-sandbox/
artifacts/practitioner-operating-plan/
artifacts/practitioners-guide-v2/

# --- Codetry handbook: web-only / build-time only --------------------------
# Web export from `expo export --platform web`; not used by native builds.
artifacts/codetry-handbook/static-build/
# PWA serve script for the web export; not used by native builds.
artifacts/codetry-handbook/server/
# Build helpers (constellation sync, dev server orchestration) — they only
# run on the developer machine before `eas build`, never on the EAS builder.
artifacts/codetry-handbook/scripts/
# Local Expo dev cache.
artifacts/codetry-handbook/.expo/
# Metro / babel / tsc caches that sometimes land inside node_modules.
artifacts/codetry-handbook/node_modules/.cache/
**/node_modules/.cache/
**/.metro-cache/
**/.metro-health-check*

# --- Workspace-level assets that no package consumes at runtime ------------
# 120+ MB of source PDFs / spreadsheets / photos used by the web artifacts
# only. They are never bundled into the Expo app.
attached_assets/
# Generated PDFs / spreadsheets exported from the slide decks.
exports/
# Author-facing docs and notes.
docs/
EAGLE_STORY_COPY.md
# Captured screenshots from the workspace tooling.
screenshots/
# Slide thumbnail caches (regenerated on demand by the slide builds).
artifacts/*/src/data/.slide-thumbnails/
# Test runner output.
test-results/

# --- Replit / agent metadata (not needed on EAS builders) ------------------
.local/
.cache/
.agents/
.replit-artifact/
.replit
.replitignore
replit.md
replit.nix
